cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these items, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
title: "AlgebraDx Open Diagnostic Item Bank for Algebra Readiness (Grades 9-12)"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-10"
authors:
  - family-names: "Sa'anga"
    given-names: "Othniel Iyassa"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-6113-6158"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher, Indianapolis, IN, USA"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Forty original multiple-choice items for diagnosing algebra readiness in grades 9-12.
  Every wrong answer is coded to one of 64 research-documented misconceptions and paired
  with a teaching move and a probe question. Includes parallel forms, a teacher guide,
  machine-readable exports and a local calibration kit. No student data collected.
keywords:
  - algebra
  - diagnostic assessment
  - misconceptions
  - item bank
  - distractor analysis
  - mathematics education
  - open educational resources
